========================================
ETHICAL HACKER CHECKLIST
========================================

Before any test:
    [ ] Get WRITTEN authorization from the system owner
    [ ] Define the scope (which IPs/domains are in scope)
    [ ] Set rules of engagement (what tools are allowed)
    [ ] Agree on testing window (time/date)

During the test:
    [ ] Stay within the defined scope
    [ ] Document everything you find
    [ ] Stop immediately if you find sensitive data unexpectedly
    [ ] Do not modify/delete data

After the test:
    [ ] Write a clear report with findings and severity
    [ ] Provide remediation recommendations
    [ ] Verify fixes after they are applied


